  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket helmet with standard protection, equipped with signal enhancers that greatly increase the pilot's mech bandwidth.\n\nA 10th-generation design from the government program that rebuilt captured pirate rigs around its own power armor and gave them to veterans who could no longer serve any other way. The Overlord was its rig for veteran mechanitors, who would command their own mechs in the field rather than join a squad.\n\nThe Overlord series is meant for a mechanitor who goes into battle alone, with only their mechs beside them. The resurrector in the shell holds a few charges and regains them slowly, so they are best saved for whichever mechs are needed most at the time. The helmet greatly increases the pilot's bandwidth at some cost to their aim, and the shoulders carry command relays that reach mechs anywhere on the map. Because the plating is far tougher than a mechanitor's usual armor, the pilot can lead from the front line rather than from behind the mechs. -->
  <OLWC_WarcasketHelmet_Overlord.description>特化型太空时代级别战棺头盔，在不增加机体重量的同时极大幅度提升了防护性，另装有信号增强器，可大幅提高驾驶员的机械带宽。\n\n第十代设计，出自一项政府计划。政府以自家的动力装甲为核心改造缴获的海盗机体，再交给除此之外再也无法服役的老兵。霸主型是其中专为资深机械师打造的型号，驾驶员不编入小队，而是在战场上亲自指挥自己的机械族。\n\n霸主型系列适合独自上阵、身边只有机械族相伴的机械师。装甲内的复活器只能储存少量充能，恢复得也很慢，最好留给当下最需要的机械族。头盔能大幅提高驾驶员的带宽，但会稍微影响射击精度。护肩装有指令中继器，让驾驶员可以指挥地图上任何位置的机械族。由于装甲板远比机械师平常穿的护甲坚固，驾驶员可以在前线亲自领军，而不必躲在机械族身后。</OLWC_WarcasketHelmet_Overlord.description>
  <!-- EN: overlord warcasket helmet -->
  <OLWC_WarcasketHelmet_Overlord.label>霸主型战棺头盔</OLWC_WarcasketHelmet_Overlord.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket helmet with standard protection, equipped with signal enhancers that greatly increase the pilot's mech bandwidth. -->
  <OLWC_WarcasketHelmet_Overlord.shortDescription>特化型太空时代级别战棺头盔，在不增加机体重量的同时极大幅度提升了防护性，另装有信号增强器，可大幅提高驾驶员的机械带宽。</OLWC_WarcasketHelmet_Overlord.shortDescription>

